{"2826790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stormforge", "steam_appid": 2826790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5056340], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stormforge is a fantasy open-world survival crafting game for 1-8 players set in a procedurally generated world filled with magical storms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/289f39c655035c57da6d79113fd7d00a.webp?t=1787942592\" width=745 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in deadly magical storms filled with key resources but fraught with danger. Harness the storms’ power to save the world of Sorana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/04c0a5eede2282ec9188915c9614565a.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/04c0a5eede2282ec9188915c9614565a.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/04c0a5eede2282ec9188915c9614565a.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/b9dd2256d50f3a21b474a1d339cd323b.webp?t=1787942592\" width=745 height=50 /></span>Wield a variety of melee, ranged, and magical weapons to battle against sinister foes who are draining the land of its lifeforce. Tread carefully around dangerous enemies who draw strength from the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/d149dda2d1ffaea342a8303766344a4b.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/d149dda2d1ffaea342a8303766344a4b.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/d149dda2d1ffaea342a8303766344a4b.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/e45a31b9394eb60d93d76630a7c8fce3.webp?t=1787942592\" width=745 height=49 /></span>Explore the vast procedurally-generated world of Sorana with endless islands of secrets, treasures, enemies, and environments. Find the source of darkness that causes the storms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/ea14ded274deb2916356e51210c4cd34.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/ea14ded274deb2916356e51210c4cd34.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/ea14ded274deb2916356e51210c4cd34.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/47e984babb0cfd90cd1329a6077f47f8.webp?t=1787942592\" width=745 height=50 /></span>Gather critical magical elements inside the storms to craft epic weapons, armor, and structures. Build up your base to withstand the power of the storms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/7366ff7270098ae8b95091f5ce65b767.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/7366ff7270098ae8b95091f5ce65b767.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/7366ff7270098ae8b95091f5ce65b767.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/4adf28d436e406aee39d26f8a7926d5f.webp?t=1787942592\" width=576 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities across multiple character classes. Play how you want by mixing and matching skills from Warrior, Ranger, Mage, Forager or Villager. Over 100 skills and 20+ active abilities allow you to make meaningful choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/51fab17fabd9011d0ae9590c471a0484.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/51fab17fabd9011d0ae9590c471a0484.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/51fab17fabd9011d0ae9590c471a0484.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/80b57157513094ce0bbdbabb4666ff9a.webp?t=1787942592\" width=745 height=50 /></span>Embark on an epic solo adventure or join with friends in 8 player co-op gameplay. Unlock unique and complementary powers that allow you to thrive as a team.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/5a4d92b6113bfcd02fb773d76af87b6f.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/5a4d92b6113bfcd02fb773d76af87b6f.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/5a4d92b6113bfcd02fb773d76af87b6f.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/f318d30368a05afd72a61b5099ac2f4d.webp?t=1787942592\" width=745 height=50 /></span>Easily play with a wide variety of community created equipment, enemies, points of interest, and game rules. Choose to add mods into your existing game without any separate downloads. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/95e9f280576a7c32c4d09de788e1b46d.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/95e9f280576a7c32c4d09de788e1b46d.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/95e9f280576a7c32c4d09de788e1b46d.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the storm-filled world of Sorana and experience a survival adventure like no other! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stormforge is a fantasy open-world survival crafting game for 1-8 players set in a procedurally generated world filled with magical storms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/289f39c655035c57da6d79113fd7d00a.webp?t=1787942592\" width=745 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive in deadly magical storms filled with key resources but fraught with danger. Harness the storms’ power to save the world of Sorana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/04c0a5eede2282ec9188915c9614565a.poster.avif?t=1787942592\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/04c0a5eede2282ec9188915c9614565a.webm?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826790/extras/04c0a5eede2282ec9188915c9614565a.mp4?t=1787942592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vide